## Project Structure

- Utils: One file per function in `src/utils/` with barrel export via `index.ts`
- SEO utilities: `src/utils/seo/`
- Constants: `src/constants/`
- Hooks: `src/hooks/` with brief JSDoc comments

## Code Style

- Files should not exceed ~100 lines. If larger, split into:
  - Utility functions in `src/utils/`
  - Custom hooks in `src/hooks/`
  - Smaller components
- One React component per file
- Extract complex logic from components into hooks or utils
- Components: `export default function ComponentName()`
- Hooks/utils: `export function useSomething()` (named export)

## SEO

- Use `generateMetadata()` from `src/utils/seo` for all page metadata
- Hidden pages: add to `HIDDEN_ROUTES` in `middleware.ts` + set `noIndex: true`
- Public pages: add to `PUBLIC_PAGES` in `src/utils/seo/publicPages.ts`
- Production URL: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` env variable

## Next.js

- App Router in `src/app/`
- Route groups: `(pages)` for content pages
- Dynamic game: `[[...slug]]/` with client-only rendering
